## Stage 5 — Fine-Tuned Model on Habsiguda Corridor

### Environment Snapshot

Same corridor as Stage 4, but with tuned reward parameters:

| Parameter | Stage 4 | Stage 5 (Fine-Tuned) |
|-----------|---------|----------------------|
| **Min Green Time** | 10 | **20** |
| **Phase Change Penalty** | -0.05 | **-1.0** |
| **Training Episodes** | 100 | 100 |

### Results — Stage 5 (Fine-Tuned)

| Metric | RL Agent | Fixed-Time Baseline | Change |
|--------|---------|--------------------:|--------|
| **Throughput (veh/h)** | 824.4 | 926.7 | -11.0% |
| **Vehicles Completed** | 824.4 | 927.0 | -11.1% |
| **Avg Waiting Time (s)** | 1.86 | 3.11 | **+40.2% ↓** |
| **Avg Queue Length** | 55.34 | 77.03 | **+28.2% ↓** |
| **Avg Speed (m/s)** | 7.67 | 7.29 | **+5.1% ↑** |
| **Phase Changes** | 553.2 | 450.0 | +22.9% |

![Fine-tuned model comparison chart](C:/Users/HP/.gemini/antigravity/brain/58539d9e-98a7-4db9-abeb-cef76220d619/comparison_finetuned.png)

![Per-episode breakdown - Fine-tuned vs Baseline](C:/Users/HP/.gemini/antigravity/brain/58539d9e-98a7-4db9-abeb-cef76220d619/per_episode_comparison.png)

![Habsiguda training curves over fine-tuning](C:/Users/HP/.gemini/antigravity/brain/58539d9e-98a7-4db9-abeb-cef76220d619/habsiguda_training_curves.png)

### Habsiguda Training Progression

| Episode Block | Avg Reward | Avg Throughput (veh/h) | Trend |
|---------------|----------:|----------------------:|-------|
| Ep 1–10 | -430.9 | 858.6 | Exploratory |
| Ep 11–25 | -649.2 | 893.5 | Dip (adapting) |
| Ep 26–50 | -632.2 | 968.9 | Improving throughput |
| Ep 51–75 | -623.3 | 968.4 | Stabilizing |
| Ep 76–100 | -608.1 | 978.8 | Best phase |

